#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:68
msgid "Synastry"
msgstr "Synastrie"

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:70
msgid ""
"Synastry overlays two charts and finds aspects formed between the planets"
" of one person and the planets of the other."
msgstr ""
"La synastrie superpose deux thèmes et trouve les aspects formés entre les "
"planètes d'une personne et les planètes de l'autre."

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:80
msgid ""
"`chart_a`, `chart_b` — `CHART_DTYPE` structured arrays from "
"`compute_chart`"
msgstr ""
"`chart_a`, `chart_b` — tableaux structurés `CHART_DTYPE` issus de "
"`compute_chart`"

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:81
msgid ""
"`aspects` — aspect set: `\"classical\"` (default), `\"traditional\"`, "
"`\"extended\"`, or a list/mask"
msgstr ""
"`aspects` — ensemble d'aspects : `\"classical\"` (défaut), `\"traditional\"`, "
"`\"extended\"`, ou une liste/masque"

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:82
msgid ""
"`orbs` — orb set: `\"synastry\"` applies the standard synastry orb "
"reduction factor"
msgstr ""
"`orbs` — ensemble d'orbes : `\"synastry\"` applique le facteur de réduction "
"d'orbe standard pour la synastrie"

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:83
msgid ""
"`mode` — `\"filtered\"` returns only active aspects; `\"all\"` returns "
"every body pair"
msgstr ""
"`mode` — `\"filtered\"` retourne uniquement les aspects actifs ; `\"all\"` "
"retourne chaque paire de corps"

