"16 points par thème."

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:124
msgid "Composite Charts"
msgstr "Thèmes composites"

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:126
msgid ""
"A composite chart is constructed from the midpoints of each pair of "
"planets, houses, and angles between two natal charts. It represents the "
"energy of the relationship rather than either individual."
msgstr ""
"Un thème composite est construit à partir des points médians de chaque paire "
"de planètes, maisons et angles entre deux thèmes nataux. Il représente "
"l'énergie de la relation plutôt que celle de l'un ou l'autre individu."

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:134
msgid ""
"Returns a single `CHART_DTYPE` structured array. The house system is re-"
"calculated from the composite Ascendant and Midheaven."
msgstr ""
"Retourne un seul tableau structuré `CHART_DTYPE`. Le système de maisons est "
"recalculé à partir de l'Ascendant et du Milieu du ciel composites."

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:152
msgid "circular_midpoint"
msgstr "circular_midpoint"

#: ../../source/relational_charts.md:154
msgid ""
"`circular_midpoint` computes the shortest-arc midpoint between two "
"ecliptic longitudes, handling the 0°/360° wraparound correctly."
msgstr ""
"`circular_midpoint` calcule le point médian sur l'arc le plus court entre "
"deux longitudes écliptiques, en gérant correctement le bouclage 0°/360°."

